hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-63 : List Word
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-63 = unlines (cons "Knowledge-graph technology has spent twenty-five years adding layers to an assertion: provenance, identity links," (cons "rules, constraints, confidences, versions and retrieval. Hyperactivity replaces the assertion with a construction." (cons "An object is code with a type, addressed by content. An edge is a relation together with its rationale. Identity is" (cons "a path that determines what it transports. Evidence warrants exactly what holds over every compatible history." (cons "Derived knowledge is a maintained view whose certificate knows when it stops being current. The schema, the queries" (cons "and the language are values of the graph they govern. The work that produces and uses knowledge is part of the same" (cons "graph. Forgetting is a fiber, equivalence is lossless transport, arbitrary arity and higher cells turn binary edges" (cons "into a cubical dependent hypergraph, and networked sharing is local interaction across a port with no canonical state." (cons "Each of the five promises of a knowledge graph (identity, justification, composition, inference and currency) is a property of this object, and every existing format embeds in it." nil)))))))))
